WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.895
When disaster strikes and a civilian is trapped, every kilobyte matters.

2
00:00:04.845 --> 00:00:14.940
HimalSanket's SOS Distress Capsule transmits ultralight micro-packets with exact GPS coordinates first, guaranteed to puncture fleeting 2G signal windows.

3
00:00:14.940 --> 00:00:23.154
At Search and Rescue headquarters, incoming distress calls are automatically prioritized by elevation vulnerability and medical urgency.

4
00:00:23.154 --> 00:00:34.202
With one click, commanders dispatch search and rescue helicopter sorties, streaming live telemetry, terrain clearance vectors, and real-time flight tracking directly to rescue teams.
